  "offensiveAbilities": [
    {
      "name": "Gotcha!",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>A floating femur freezes up if Grabbed. For 1 minute after the femur becomes grabbed or Restrained by a creature, the femur can't act, and the creature holding it can use it as a <em>+1 club</em> with the fatal d10 trait. After that time, the floating femur can act and is generally quite aggressive toward whomever used it as a weapon.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
  ],
  "spellcastingEntries": [],
  "description": "<p>Floating femurs can deliver a powerful blow. They make handy weapons for those who manage to grab hold of them.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Commonly mistaken for undead, animated bones are mindless constructs with no connection to necromancy. The following are examples of typical animated bones.</p>",
